@startuml 05_System_Context
title System Context - SplitSmart (web application, D01/D06)
actor "Group member\n(browser)" as U
actor "Anonymous visitor\n(browser)" as A
rectangle "SplitSmart\nSpring Boot web application\n(Layered + MVC, Thymeleaf)" as SS #LightBlue
database "Amazon RDS\nPostgreSQL 16" as DB
cloud "Amazon SES" as SES
cloud "AWS Secrets Manager" as SM
actor "User email inbox" as INBOX

U --> SS : HTTPS: sessions, forms\n(expenses, approvals, settlements, reports)
A --> SS : HTTPS: register, verify, reset,\ninvitation preview
SS --> DB : JDBC over TLS\n(all data incl. receipts BYTEA, D13)
SS --> SES : SendEmail (verification and\npassword reset only, D31)
SES --> INBOX : email
SS --> SM : read DB credentials at startup

note right of SS
  No push notifications; approval requests are
  in-app only (D04, D26). No S3 (D13).
  No CSV export (D05).
end note
@enduml
